sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Sender
    participant WA as Gateway A
    participant PS as Pub/sub
    participant St as Message store
    participant WB as Gateway B
    participant B as Recipient
    A->>WA: send over its WebSocket
    WA->>St: persist first, assign a sequence number
    Note over St: persist before delivering — an undelivered message must survive
    WA->>PS: publish to the recipient's topic
    PS->>WB: the gateway holding B's connection
    WB->>B: deliver
    B-->>WB: ack
    WB->>St: mark delivered
    alt B is offline
        St->>St: hold it
        B->>WB: reconnects, asks for anything after its last sequence number
        WB-->>B: the backlog, in order
    end
